# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  StartupRisk AI v2  —  knowledge_base/.gitignore
#  The .txt source files ARE committed (they are the RAG corpus).
#  Generated/cached artifacts are ignored.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════


#  Commit all .txt files (RAG knowledge corpus) 
# All 20 .txt files in subdirectories should be tracked.
# No negation needed — just ignore everything non-.txt below.


#  Ignore any accidental binary/generated files 
*.pdf
*.docx
*.xlsx
*.csv
*.json
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.npy
*.bin


#  Ignore OS and editor artifacts 
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
desktop.ini


#  Ignore any temp processing outputs 
processed/
chunks/
embeddings/
*.tmp